          <rules>
            <rule id="bea4-271b-327c-a857" name="Transfix" hidden="false">
              <description>At the beginning of the Close Combat phase select one model in base contact with the Vampire The selected model must take a Leadership test. If the test is failed, the victim cannot attack in that Close Combat phase.</description>
