          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="4c88-860b-2dcc-5e59" name="Beguile" hidden="false">
              <description>What brute would dare to attack such a vulnerable lady?

At the beginning of the Close Combat phase select one model in base contact with the Vampire. The selected model must take a Leadership test. If the test is failed, the victim cannot attack the Vampire in that Close Combat phase.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
